description=Experimental desktop stereo and OpenXR head tracking for Viewpoint 0.1.6.1. Single player, first person, on foot, native Viewpoint shaders. On-screen Off/Desktop/XR fixed/XR tracked controls; Pause/Break turns Off, Shift+Pause/Break saves a pair while Off. Five-second recenter and adjustable scale. Transparent headset panel includes game UI and Viewpoint overlays; desktop mouse/keyboard interaction. Optional controller UI pointer, walking, snap/smooth turning, persistent preferences, and logged UI diagnostics. Tracked hand models are not implemented. See the project testing guide for testing and limitations.
